{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120531","id":3907587515,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7o6Q27","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120531","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120531.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120531.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120531","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120531/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120531/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120531/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9ab85652209ec1b72a2ee71e2c8f3f0945c33121","number":120531,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix ItemList separations being applied to outer edges","user":{"login":"sydist","id":81040138,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQwMTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81040138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist","html_url":"https://github.com/sydist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**The Problem:**\r\n`ItemList` bakes `h_separation` and `v_separation` into every item's rect size, then offsets content inward by half the separation when drawing. This means the first column, first row, and last column/row all get unwanted spacing on the outer edges, where there are no neighboring items to separate from. \r\n\r\nThis is inconsistent with `BoxContainer`, `GridContainer`, and `FlowContainer`, which only apply separations between items.\r\n\r\n**The Fix:**\r\nThis PR moves separation handling into the layout loop instead, adding `h_separation` before each item that isn't in column 0 and `v_separation` when moving to the next row.\r\n\r\nAlso fixes `same_column_width` double-counting `h_separation` (once in `minsize`, once added on top), making uniform columns wider than they should be.\r\n\r\nPartially addresses #88217\r\n\r\n**Before:**\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b27af5da-2adb-4765-8e17-41dd4f8ad9fc\r\n\r\n**After:**\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/277f5361-56da-4d44-b6af-62cf0a823f50\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues